  <name>FreedomOffice Calc</name>
  <summary>Spreadsheet program of the FreedomOffice productivity suite</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
Calc is a powerful and extensible spreadsheet program, part of the FreedomOffice
productivity suite.
Newcomers find it intuitive and easy to learn.
Professional data miners and number crunchers will appreciate the comprehensive
range of advanced functions.
</p>
    <p>
FreedomOffice supports opening and saving into a wide variety of formats, so you
can easily share spreadsheets with users of other popular office suites without
worrying about compatibility.
</p>
  </description>
